<title>SINGAPORE: Eng Kong appoints financial chief.</title>
<headline>Eng Kong appoints financial chief.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shipping container logistics firm Eng Kong Holdings said on Wednesday it had appointed Dennis Chan Yin Ming as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Chan will oversee all aspects of the group's finance, business planning and risk management.</p>
<p>Chan was formerly chief financial officer and company secretary of container manufacturer and operator, Singamas Container Holdings Ltd in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
